  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ～🔔*゜</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">前々回の握手会できつねの格好をしたので</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そちらの写真特集をしたいと思います🦊</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">Qなぜ狐なの？</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">A「秋っぽい動物といえば…きつね？」となんとなーく思ったからです！すごくアバウト。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あーでもリスの方が秋っぽいかも？</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">まぁ置いといて!!</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">どうぞ🤘</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【1部】</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3640.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ฅ(•∀•ฅ)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">シンプルにストレート下ろしにしました。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">半袖にマフラーという異様な格好ですが</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この日は室内が寒かったので温かくてちょうど良かったです！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">きつねうどん食べたくなりますね～</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">顔が狐に似てると自分では思っているのですが、どう思いますか??</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【3部】</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3637.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">( ˙꒳​˙&nbsp; )</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">巻きツインテール！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">メイクさんに「似合う髪型おまかせで！」と</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">頼んだところこの髪型+金色のヘアピンもつけて下さりました🤩&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4083.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">実は尻尾も付いているんです！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こっちもお気に入り。なのですが、</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">休憩時間はまなもが抱き枕にしていました。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">愛された尻尾です。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">より狐感が増しますね✌🏻</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">─────────────────</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">狐とのツーショットコーナー🦊</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3634.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">このちゃん！マフラーいいでしょ！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">七色いんこのお稽古大変だと思うけど</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">頑張ってね✦舞台見に行くの楽しみです👀</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私もちょっと舞台ロスです。さやかちゃん…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3629.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">たんちゃん！お誕生日おめでとう🎂</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">しっかり者のひよたん。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">実は寝起きは1番良いのです。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">16歳共に頑張ろう～！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これからもよろしくね( ¨̮ )</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3639.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なお！これが噂のキャラメルミルクですね。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私が持ってるのはチョコミルク。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">キャラメル飲まなかったから後悔してます…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今度飲みます！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">─────────────────</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">次は4部5部のブログもすぐ書きますね💨</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あと全国握手会のブログも！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3636.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#61</span></p></div>\n                    ",
  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>金村<rt>かなむら</rt></ruby>ブログ<ruby>更新<rt>こうしん</rt></ruby>のお<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>ですよ～🔔*゜</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>前々回<rt>ぜんぜんかい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>できつねの<ruby>格好<rt>かっこう</rt></ruby>をしたので</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そちらの<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>特集<rt>とくしゅう</rt></ruby>をしたいと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います🦊</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">Qなぜ<ruby>狐<rt>きつね</rt></ruby>なの？</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">A「<ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby>っぽい<ruby>動物<rt>どうぶつ</rt></ruby>といえば…きつね？」となんとなーく<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>ったからです！すごくアバウト。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あーでもリスの<ruby>方<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>が<ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby>っぽいかも？</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">まぁ<ruby>置<rt>お</rt></ruby>いといて!!</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">どうぞ🤘</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【1<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3640.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ฅ(•∀•ฅ)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">シンプルにストレート<ruby>下<rt>お</rt></ruby>ろしにしました。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>半袖<rt>はんそで</rt></ruby>にマフラーという<ruby>異様<rt>いよう</rt></ruby>な<ruby>格好<rt>かっこう</rt></ruby>ですが</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この<ruby>日<rt>ひ</rt></ruby>は<ruby>室内<rt>しつない</rt></ruby>が<ruby>寒<rt>さむ</rt></ruby>かったので<ruby>温<rt>あたた</rt></ruby>かくてちょうど<ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>かったです！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">きつねうどん<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたくなりますね～</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>顔<rt>かお</rt></ruby>が<ruby>狐<rt>きつね</rt></ruby>に<ruby>似<rt>に</rt></ruby>てると<ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>では<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>っているのですが、どう<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>いますか??</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【3<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3637.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">( ˙꒳​˙&nbsp; )</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>巻<rt>ま</rt></ruby>きツインテール！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">メイクさんに「<ruby>似合<rt>にあ</rt></ruby>う<ruby>髪型<rt>かみがた</rt></ruby>おまかせで！」と</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>頼<rt>たの</rt></ruby>んだところこの<ruby>髪型<rt>かみがた</rt></ruby>+<ruby>金色<rt>きんいろ</rt></ruby>のヘアピンもつけて<ruby>下<rt>した</rt></ruby>さりました🤩&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4083.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>実<rt>じつ</rt></ruby>は<ruby>尻尾<rt>しっぽ</rt></ruby>も<ruby>付<rt>つ</rt></ruby>いているんです！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こっちもお<ruby>気に入<rt>きにい</rt></ruby>り。なのですが、</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>休憩<rt>きゅうけい</rt></ruby><ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>はまなもが<ruby>抱<rt>いだ</rt></ruby>き<ruby>枕<rt>まくら</rt></ruby>にしていました。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>愛<rt>あい</rt></ruby>された<ruby>尻尾<rt>しっぽ</rt></ruby>です。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">より<ruby>狐<rt>きつね</rt></ruby><ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>が<ruby>増<rt>ま</rt></ruby>しますね✌🏻</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">─────────────────</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>狐<rt>きつね</rt></ruby>とのツーショットコーナー🦊</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3634.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">このちゃん！マフラーいいでしょ！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>七<rt>なな</rt></ruby><ruby>色<rt>しょく</rt></ruby>いんこのお<ruby>稽古<rt>けいこ</rt></ruby><ruby>大変<rt>たいへん</rt></ruby>だと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>うけど</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>ってね✦<ruby>舞台<rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby><ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>に<ruby>行<rt>い</rt></ruby>くの<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみです👀</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>もちょっと<ruby>舞台<rt>ぶたい</rt></ruby>ロスです。さやかちゃん…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3629.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">たんちゃん！お<ruby>誕生<rt>たんじょう</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>び</rt></ruby>おめでとう🎂</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">しっかり<ruby>者<rt>しゃ</rt></ruby>のひよたん。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>実<rt>じつ</rt></ruby>は<ruby>寝起<rt>ねお</rt></ruby>きは1<ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby>良<rt>よ</rt></ruby>いのです。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">16<ruby>歳<rt>さい</rt></ruby><ruby>共<rt>ども</rt></ruby>に<ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>ろう～！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これからもよろしくね( ¨̮ )</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3639.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なお！これが<ruby>噂<rt>うわさ</rt></ruby>のキャラメルミルクですね。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が<ruby>持<rt>も</rt></ruby>ってるのはチョコミルク。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">キャラメル<ruby>飲<rt>の</rt></ruby>まなかったから<ruby>後悔<rt>こうかい</rt></ruby>してます…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>今度<rt>こんど</rt></ruby><ruby>飲<rt>の</rt></ruby>みます！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">─────────────────</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>次<rt>つぎ</rt></ruby>は4<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>5<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>のブログもすぐ<ruby>書<rt>か</rt></ruby>きますね💨</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あと<ruby>全国<rt>ぜんこく</rt></ruby><ruby>握手<rt>あくしゅ</rt></ruby><ruby>会<rt>かい</rt></ruby>のブログも！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-10-02/26357_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3636.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#61</span></p></div>\n                    ",
